5,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I worry about timetables slipping when external conditions change.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,We should check if similar ideas failed before.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,Staff capacity is the real bottleneck here.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,Funding structures often hide long-term costs.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Location and opening hours decide who can actually reach us.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, do you have specific examples in mind?","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Just a hunch, but records exist.","{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Minako, how do you usually spot those traps?","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,I look at the grant terms and endowment rules.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I need to see the bus links and road closures.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I’ll check the winter road closures and delivery windows.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I want to see the two programmes from six years ago.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,I’ll look at the volunteer register and tool certification.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,I’ll review the county grant terms and running lines.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I’ll check the bus links and evening room bookings.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Yumi,,Let’s see what the data says.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Agreed. Facts over feelings.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shion,,I’ll be ready with my findings.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Minako,,I will analyze the financial shape.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I hope the access data is clear.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
