35,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"The road closures were bad, but delivery windows slip too.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The old digitisation project left half the images unindexed.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shion,,No one on payroll is trained to supervise outside facilitators.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Minako,,"The grant only covers fees for twelve months, then it’s flat budget.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,Two outer wards lost their bus link; an hour’s round trip now.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Minako, that twelve-month limit sounds risky for long-term plans.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Shion, so we can’t rely on external staff without training?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shion,,Correct. The skills aren’t on the roster.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Minako,,"Exactly. The endowment covers capital, not ongoing operations.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Yumi, did the community halls keep their timetables despite closures?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"Yes, they did. That’s a good sign for local resilience.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,But the equipment line overran by a third last year.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shion,,"The retired tradespeople are running the repair clinic, though.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Minako,,So we have volunteer energy but no supervisory structure.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"The evening rooms are full, but remote use peaks later.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Yumi,,We need a plan that doesn’t depend on perfect weather or delivery.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,And one that doesn’t repeat the indexing failure.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shion,,We must ensure staff can actually manage the new load.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Minako,,The funding must be sustainable beyond the first year.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,And it must reach people who can’t easily come to us.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
