60,3,1,talk,Yumi,,"Candidate D, the Mobile Branch, seems to address the access issue.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,But the vehicle running costs overran last year.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, the mobile service needs staff, which we lack.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Minako,,"The grant covers session fees, but vehicle maintenance is capital?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,It solves the bus link problem for the outer wards.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Minako, if the vehicle is capital, the endowment might cover it.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"But the running costs are the problem, not the purchase.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Shion,,We have no trained supervisors for the mobile staff either.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Minako,,The flat budget after year one will struggle with fuel and repairs.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"The attendance at former outreach stops was high, though.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Yumi,,"High attendance suggests demand, but can we sustain it?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,The old digitisation project failed due to lack of follow-through.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Shion,,"Candidate B, the Digital Archive, might be safer for staff.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Minako,,But the scanning contractors slip their delivery windows.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,"Remote catalogue use peaks late, so a portal helps.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Yumi,,"I’m leaning towards D, but the costs worry me.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,I’m concerned about repeating past failures with B.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Shion,,"I prefer C, Language Circles, if we can find facilitators.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Minako,,"C relies on partner organizations, which might be unstable.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,D is the only one that directly fixes the access gap.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
